+  without suppressing the lint).
+- Canonical `signing_bytes` = `SIGNING_CONTEXT || canonical(UnsignedTx)`,
+  signed via C3's domain-separated `aura_crypto::sign(Domain::Tx, chain_id)`.
+  `signer` is bound to the key by
