+  (`prune(keep)` / `archive()`), `VersionRecord`, `RetentionReceipt`,
+  `CompactionReport`, `RetentionStore` (`commit`, `root_at`, `state_at`,
+  `proof_at`, `verify_root_at`, `compact`), exact byte accounting and
