+        "| `aurad report --fixture` | 0 | the same measurement as `key=value` lines (the pin) |",
+        f"| `aurad report --workspace <not a workspace>` | {fields.get('exit_no_workspace', ['?'])[0]} | refuses: there is nothing to measure |",
